{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running an errand for an old friend inadvertently drags ex-gang leader Dan into a brutal smuggler war in a border town.<br>He\u2019ll pay any price to achieve his goal\u2014and make everyone else pay, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No mercy. No compromise. At any cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/CAR_DESERT_3-N2.gif?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the shifting quicksand of narrative and gameplay. Unravel a web of interconnected events that lead Dan down a path he never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/paths_\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u044f.png?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/C_ASSAULT_1.gif?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1748344464\" /><strong>Large, dynamic levels</strong> offer tactical freedom and adrenaline-pumping encounters\u2014from luxury hotel penthouses to ancient temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break windows, slide across furniture, and use the environment to strike fast and clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catch enemies off guard. Stay sharp. Return fire with style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/C_ASSAULT_2.gif?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/C_ASSAULT_3.gif?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/NARRATIVE_\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u044f.png?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re taking you into a <strong>linear story with layered perception</strong>. The events remain the same, but your interpretation of them changes based on how you engage with the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/MESSENGER.gif?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose to spend time talking\u2014or skip the chatter. The story will adapt to your depth of attention, transforming your experience from a gritty gangster thriller into something much deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Days in the life of Dan - a former bootlegger gang leader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 handcrafted, large-scale levels</strong>, each in a distinct location (no AI or procedural generation)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 distinct weapons</strong> tailored to varied playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A whole Wild West town for you to explore, full of stories and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original electronic soundtrack</strong>, rhythmically angry and composed exclusively for the game</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3474390?t=1748344464","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/4a4b4e699aed1bd3e65356dcdaf7bb6169407fad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748344464","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/172b