f guard. Stay sharp. Return fire with style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/C_ASSAULT_2.gif?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/C_ASSAULT_3.gif?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/NARRATIVE_\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u044f.png?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re taking you into a <strong>linear story with layered perception</strong>. The events remain the same, but your interpretation of them changes based on how you engage with the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/MESSENGER.gif?t=1748344464\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose to spend time talking\u2014or skip the chatter. The story will adapt to your depth of attention, transforming your experience from a gritty gangster thriller into something much deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Days in the life of Dan - a former bootlegger gang leader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 handcrafted, large-scale levels</strong>, each in a distinct location (no AI or procedural generation)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 distinct weapons</strong> tailored to varied playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A whole Wild West town for you to explore, full of stories and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original electronic soundtrack</strong>, rhythmically angry and composed exclusively for the game</p></li></ul>","developers":["Classified Office"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/421eba97fb7991108323101330ad5dc520f35820/header.jpg?t=1748344464","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"BOILED","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i3 1115<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GTX 660ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Classified Office"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nTemas sens\u00edveis\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/7a7f553b2a73c1037d73d0070defd5f8c29190ea/ss_7a7f553b2a73c1037d73d0070defd5f8c29190ea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748344464","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/7a7f553b2a73c1037d73d0070defd5f8c29190ea/ss_7a7f553b2a73c1037d73d0070defd5f8c29190ea.600x338.jpg?t=1748344464"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/cac0bdce4b05f94defd1f6da8adb54e4c8f27618/ss_cac0bdce4b05f94defd1f6da8adb54e4c8f27618.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748344464","p